# Moby-Dick oracle batch 2 (public domain). Chapters 5-6, disjoint
# from ch.1-2 prose eval. Targets: possessive have (pilot leak),
# -s verbs (afford, looks), imperatives (let x2, be), names
# (Queequeg, Ledyard, Mungo Park), J1 New/ADJ, all/DET, more/ADJ.
# EWT-side conventions per CANONICAL.md; notes on judgment calls below.
# - `next him`: next/ADP (elided "to"; preposition-like).
# - `any one man`: one/NUM (cardinal-like determiner slot).
# - `open` in `flinging open a door`: ADJ (object complement).
# - `more` in `there is more`: ADJ (EWT never PRON for more).
# - `backward` in `be backward`: ADJ (predicative).
